  "description": "A .NET command-line tool for batch-normalizing icon images into a consistent set. Reduces each image to a flat single-colour coverage mask that carries its shape, anti-aliased edges included, entirely in the alpha channel, trims transparent margins, centres the artwork on a square canvas, and resizes it to a maximum dimension with optional padding. Built on ImageSharp with no native dependencies, making it a fast way to unify icon packs collected from different sources.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
